[ext_resource type="PackedScene" path="res://assets/models/props/prp_ruin_wall.glb" id="1_wall"]

; The Deep Stacks door (WR-spec2-07): a ruin wall slab with a seam of lead down the middle, no handle and
; no lock. It fills the vault court's gate, so it IS the gate: hidden by flag.beat.stacks_open. The slab is
; 4 m wide and 4 m tall (the model's own 2 m, doubled by its glTF root scale); the lead runs as one vertical
; seam with two short ties across it, deliberately not a cross.

